odal_description: [Shot 1] Flat-style scientific illustration, low-saturation Morandi palette, haze blue and warm gray dominant with pale gold and ink green accents, clean minimal composition, subject centered, soft diffused lighting, serene and contemplative atmosphere. A quantum particle sits in the center of the frame; on the left an abstract geometric measurement hand reaches in, causing the particle to collapse into a defined point; on the right another abstract hand reaches in, keeping the particle in a diffused waveform. The two hands alternate gently touching the particle, its form switching between point and wave. The camera slowly trucks right with small amplitude. [Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the camera cuts to two independent glowing orbs placed side by side. The left orb contains quantum orbit lines and formula symbols representing science, the right orb contains Tai Chi diagrams and misty mountain landscapes representing Eastern wisdom. An equals sign glows between them, expressing parallel coexistence rather than replacement. Both orbs pulse softly in sync. The camera slowly pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed. [Shot 3] At 00:09.000, the camera cuts to an ancient bronze mirror centered in the frame, its frame adorned with simple traditional patterns, quantum particles and Taoist cloud qi drifting around it. The mirror surface gradually emits a faint shimmer. The camera slowly pushes in, focusing on the mirror surface. [Shot 4] At 00:13.000, the bronze mirror reveals two overlapping reflections inside: quantum orbits and formulas on the left, Tai Chi mountains and flowing clouds on the right. The two reflections merge into a single glowing unified whole. A pale golden halo expands from the mirror, filling the frame with soft light. The camera slowly pulls out and holds a static shot as the light settles.\n\noverall_soundscape: Soft resonant chime tones, subtle atmospheric hum, gentle whooshing as particles drift, a warm sustained tone as the mirror 